  <title xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">JPO evaluation study</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2" xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The specific objectives of the study are to:
1.	Identify career trajectories: Analyse the career trajectories of former Danish JPOs since 2010, including their continued engagement with the UN and other international or Danish development institutions.
2.	Assess satisfaction and programme quality: Examine JPOs&#x2019; satisfaction with employment conditions, recruitment, onboarding, mentoring, and career support provided through the programme.
3.	Identify lessons and recommendations: Identify concrete elements of the programme that can be strengthened or adapted to ensure continued relevance, effectiveness, and alignment with Danish priorities and multilateral trends.</narrative>
  </description>
